== Title decisions ==

* '''[[Adaptation]] → [[Adaptation (systems)]]''' because unqualified adaptation has durable meanings in evolutionary biology, physiology, cognition, media adaptation, and ordinary language.
* [[Information]] remains unqualified because the page can legitimately serve as a broad umbrella distinguishing semantic, probabilistic, physical, and computational senses.
* [[Entropy]] remains unqualified because the article will explicitly distinguish thermodynamic/statistical entropy from Shannon entropy while explaining their mathematical relationship.
* [[Feedback]], [[Emergence]], [[Self-organization]], [[Complex system]], [[Network]], and [[Robustness]] remain unqualified because their intended public scope is broader than one discipline and can support cross-domain articles.
* [[Network]] must not collapse into [[Computer network]]; the Core page will treat network as a general relational structure.

